   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nordpraktik 98</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nordpraktik 98</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the spring 1998, 11 trainees from Estonia, Latvia and Kaliningrad worked at different companies in the southeastern part of Sweden. In the autumn did 10 Russian trainees participate in a parallell exchangeprogramme in the north of Sweden. During the periods did the groups attend courses in social science, market economy and gender issues.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under v&#xE5;ren 1998, arbetade 11 praktikanter fr&#xE5;n Estland, Lettland och Kaliningrad p&#xE5; olika f&#xF6;retag i syd&#xF6;stra Sverige. Under h&#xF6;sten deltog 10 ryssar i ett praktikprogram p&#xE5; f&#xF6;retag i Norrbotten. Under b&#xE5;da dessa perioder deltog grupperna i seminarier med in- riktning p&#xE5; svensk statskunskap, marknadsekonomi och j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet.</narrative>
  </description>
